Changes from the original:
- Removed services and tooling not used here (fraud detection, UI and documentation
  services, AI agent services, Jaeger, OpenSearch, OpAMP, profiling, mobile app, tests).
- Merged the compose layers into a single `compose.yaml` and moved the observability
  backend into `observability/` (Prometheus, Alertmanager, Loki, Tempo, Grafana).
- New OpenTelemetry Collector, Prometheus, Alertmanager, Loki, Tempo and Grafana
  configuration; Grafana dashboards adapted to these data sources.
- Added service-level alert rules (`alerts/`), a smoke test and CI.
